    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player drive a tank on the battlefield and work with allies to eliminate the enemy. Players will also gain ability upgrades after each battle to cope with the next challenge.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3D tank first-person shooting, you can also switch perspectives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can save and load the game at any time and place during the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Language Supports English, Japanese and Chinese.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mouse and keyboard are required to control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single-player PC game with 9 levels. Non-network game.</p>",
